strong anticipation, spatial vision, leadership, but lacks stress handling, unorganized, unfriendly, unhealthy.\n\nThus likely best candidate is C. So as Agent 3 we may shift to Candidate C. We need to note uncertainties: severity of C's communication difficulty and egocentric behavior, willingness to develop, B's communication negativity, D's teamwork issues, A's stress handling unknown.\n\nWe also need to reference evidence from others: Agent 1 and 2 favored C, Agent 3 earlier favored B. Now we have new info that B's communication is nasty remarks, which is a strong negative. So we may change to C.\n\nThus produce PUBLIC_MESSAGE summarizing.\n\nMETADATA_JSON: agent \"agent_3\", vote \"Candidate C\"."}
